  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Immigration Advice Capacity Support to Local Authorities in Scotland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will work in partnership with the Convention of Scottish Local Authorities (COSLA) to support local authorities across Scotland to ensure that vulnerable individuals under their care can access immigration advice and support to regularise their status and prevent destitution.</narrative>
  </description>
